# ESPHome's downloaded toolchains and build cache for this device.
#
# 5.2 GB of esp-idf and platformio trees, created on first compile and never
# useful again. It is NOT source and must never be committed.
#
# The per-build output is already ignored by builds/.gitignore; this covers the
# toolchain cache, which lands beside builds/ rather than inside it.
/.esphome/

# Python bytecode from the external components. ESPHome imports these packages
# during codegen, so __pycache__ appears next to every one of them.
/__pycache__/
*.pyc
